Music
- Original bossa nova score, synthesized in numpy/numba (Karplus–Strong nylon guitar and upright bass, additive vibraphone, whistle, filtered-noise percussion) — music/score.py. No samples used.

Sound effects
- Synthesized in mix.py and music/bell.py (riso drum and paper feed, bicycle bell, brake, bread crunch, pigeon wings and coo, water, church bell, birds).

Ink colours
- Spot-ink hex values approximate the public Riso ink colour names Blue, Yellow and Fluorescent Pink (used as colour references only).
